[{"id":2477456234,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Tqvtq","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?u=a1f7933340521a5903fe3cc2f8216a8c0a9565ec&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-2477456234","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-2477456234"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986"}},"submitted_at":"2024-12-04T07:36:40Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2688252570,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6gO3qa","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. I've tested all 3D demo projects with all rendering methods and couldn't notice a visual regression. I also made a testing project that showcases an exponentially faster-moving camera and spheres, inspired by [this demo](https://threejs.org/examples/#webgl_camera_logarithmicdepthbuffer):\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_99986.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19265316/test_pr_99986.zip)\r\n\r\nI suggest modifying the 3D editor's View configuration dialog to allow using larger Z far values than 1 million units:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e5b9e43b-bd1f-4173-b50a-6a110074c5e3)\r\n\r\nFor comparison, this is already allowed in the Camera3D node properties.\r\n\r\nSetting the maximum to `INT32_MAX - 1` should be good enough, I suppose. (If double-precision builds support higher values, then the maximum value should be adjusted accordingly when using a double-precision build.)","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-2688252570","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-2688252570"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-15T19:30:22Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2477921953,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Tshah","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Also need to resolve the previous suggestions marked as resolved ","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-2477921953","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-2477921953"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-16T11:23:15Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3769927877,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gtIjF","user":{"login":"Ansraer","id":6329420,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjk0MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6329420?u=9b6df29991f0ca8186e28f269b6391ae5dd1bb63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer","html_url":"https://github.com/Ansraer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I took the time to thoroughly look throught this PR today after it was pointed out to me that I confused it with it's predecessor during last weeks rendering meeting.\r\n\r\nAs explained by Flarkk in the initial comment of this PR (yeah, reading comprehension is a usefull skill...) this PR does not change the actual projection matrix. Instead it adds a new struct to store the frustum planes, which means that they can be accessed with higher precision.\r\n\r\nThis also means that my concerns about breaking user shaders from last weeks meeting do not actually apply to this PR, there should be no changes in any user facing code.\r\n\r\nOverall both this approach and the implementation has my approval. However, there is one minor thing I would like to see addressed before this is merged:\r\nThe new frustum struct is stored in `RenderSceneDataRD`.  However, unlike the `cam_transform` and `cam_projection`, there are no getters in `RenderSceneData` for users to retrieve the Frustum data.\r\nGiven that the goal of this PR is to never reconstruct that data from the matrices not exposing the frustum struct to users feels like a critical oversight.\r\n\r\nOnce the necessary getters have been added and registered with the ClassDB I will approve this PR.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-3769927877","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-3769927877"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-08T16:14:45Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3809160045,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7jCytt","user":{"login":"Ansraer","id":6329420,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjk0MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6329420?u=9b6df29991f0ca8186e28f269b6391ae5dd1bb63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer","html_url":"https://github.com/Ansraer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Yeah, this looks good to me. Thanks for making the changes I requested.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-3809160045","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-3809160045"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-16T15:12:54Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3809507666,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7jEHlS","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?u=24618295fece29a0bf5c850faf2555985232f5f2&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-3809507666","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-3809507666"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-16T16:23:06Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3834025407,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7khpW_","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally on `3d_primitives.tscn` from the [Tonemapping and Color Correction demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/tonemap_color_correction), it works as expected. Code looks good to me. Thanks for adding unit tests too 🙂 \n\nSome feedback:\n\n- I got a Vulkan driver crash when setting a Camera3D node's Far property to `9999999` even though I wasn't currently previewing it:\n\n```\n================================================================\nhandle_crash: Program crashed with signal 11\nEngine version: Godot Engine v4.7.dev.custom_build (7b9f27a17049c8d16ff1492cd2407802e53756b6)\nDumping the backtrace. Please include this when reporting the bug on: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues\n[1] /lib64/libc.so.6(+0x1a290) [0x7fcc83c92290] (??:0)\n[2] /lib64/libnvidia-glcore.so.580.119.02(+0xddd330) [0x7fcbed9dd330] (??:0)\n[3] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0x6629df2] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp:6855)\n[4] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0x662ad97] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp:7043)\n[5] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0x6613465] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp:3176)\n[6] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0xa0b7e30] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:6580 (discriminator 5))\n[7] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0xa0b8d53] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:6677)\n[8] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0xa0ccffb] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/servers/rendering/rendering_device_driver.h:133)\n[9] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0xa0c9a91] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:7153)\n[10] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0xa518783] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/renderer_compositor_rd.cpp:134)\n[11] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0xa2162c1] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/servers/rendering/rendering_server_default.cpp:112)\n[12] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0xa218c59] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/servers/rendering/rendering_server_default.cpp:447)\n[13] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0x411d526] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/main/main.cpp:4972)\n[14] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0x40073e0] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/platform/linuxbsd/os_linuxbsd.cpp:995 (discriminator 1))\n[15] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0x401fcc5] (/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot/platform/linuxbsd/godot_linuxbsd.cpp:121)\n[16] /lib64/libc.so.6(+0x35b5) [0x7fcc83c7b5b5] (??:0)\n[17] /lib64/libc.so.6(__libc_start_main+0x88) [0x7fcc83c7b668] (??:0)\n[18] bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64() [0x3ffb825] (??:?)\n-- END OF C++ BACKTRACE --\n================================================================\n```\n\nI can't reproduce this crash consistently though. I've been able to set a **Far** property to `2**63 - 1` without trouble:\n\n<img width=\"499\" height=\"44\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98d2ab28-f890-45c4-aba0-84a3302926bb\" />\n\n- In Forward+, I noticed that perspective with a FOV of 1 degree manages *better* precision than orthographic rendering:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc19f830-3be9-4f4d-acf5-09650346d7b0\n\nThis is also noticeable when SSR is enabled (not shown on the video above). It's strange, as I would logically expect the opposite (very low perspective FOVs often exacerbate depth buffer precision issues).\n\nIt's the opposite in Mobile where orthogonal has very good precision, but perspective looks very unstable with lots of Z-fighting.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-3834025407","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pullrequestreview-3834025407"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99986"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-20T20:11:36Z","commit_id":null},{"id":4411466274,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBvGiIg","user":{"login":"Fahien","id":6058008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTgwMDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6058008?u=a46771ef34728e6a71d688dbc8ef6cdad27a2f55&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien","html_url":"https://github.com/Fahien","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99986#pull